Subject: [PATCH] Use shared aggregate initialization joins for native
 compilation

---
 Cargo.lock                                           | 12 ++++++------
 Cargo.toml                                           |  8 ++++----
 .../+native-initialization-joins.performance.md      |  1 +
 3 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 newsfragments/+native-initialization-joins.performance.md

diff --git a/Cargo.lock b/Cargo.lock
